            "tone": "result",
            "text": "A 1-carat round brilliant in six platinum claws, ringed by sixteen micro-pavé diamonds, on a yellow-gold band with milgrain edges, plus a matching pavé wedding band. US size 6.",
            "title": "The Aurora bridal set: halo engagement ring and pavé band",
            "items": [
              "Comfort-fit band, inner diameter 16.51 mm, size set by one generator number",
              "Six-claw basket with a pierced filigree gallery and cathedral shoulders",
              "Halo of 16 stones in a beaded frame; seven pavé stones down each shoulder",
              "Milgrain beading along every edge, crisp at print detail",
              "Matching band with 13 pavé stones that sits flush beside it"
            ],
            "view": {
              "pane": "dollhouse"
            }
